# Captured Libris payloads — contain live patron data. NEVER commit.
# Only sanitised fixtures (tests/fixtures/libris/*.json) may be committed.
#
# Leading **/ matters: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to this
# file's directory, so a bare "tests/fixtures/libris/_raw/" stopped matching
# when the tree moved under ill-bridge/backend/. Depth-independent from now on.
**/tests/fixtures/libris/_raw/

# Belt and braces: any directory named _raw, wherever it appears.
**/_raw/


deploy/mailpit-data/
ui/admin/inspiration.html
